  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "People tend to still be able to fly into areas non accessible to group staff that run group lobbies. if we had a square tile selection on the menu(moderation map) to look at where the user is and be able to teleport them to spawn if there not where there supposed to be instead of removing them from the lobby that would be nice. \n\nI would like to have this as a feature, that shows what they're doing as well. I'd be able to catch crashers in the act, while not being in their vicinity, which would be very convenient for my staff and myself.\n\nHaving a timer set to 5 minutes that way you can't abuse that system it would be staff wide. that way multiple staff have to wait 5 minutes before force respawning someone.",
